# Trivy ignore list for the irs-api image scan (.github/workflows/trivy-image-scan.yml).
# The scan fails on any HIGH or CRITICAL finding that is not listed here.

# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: fixed only in Spring Framework 7.0.9, no fix available in the 6.2 line.
# Affects XsltView, which the IRS does not use.
# Re-review with the upgrade to Spring Framework 7.
CVE-2026-47884

# spring-webmvc 6.2.19: fixed in Spring Framework 7.0.9, the 6.2.20 fix is not available as open source.
# Affects view fragments sent over Server-Sent Events, which the IRS does not use.
# Re-review with the upgrade to Spring Framework 7.
CVE-2026-47890
